# Files the Vercel CLI uploads for a deployment (`vercel deploy` from your computer): only what the website needs.
# The rest of the repository (print masters, logo sources, the Obsidian vault, design-tool records: about 380 MB)
# never reaches the site. Keep this list in step with what app/, components/ and lib/ import.

# Ignore everything at the root, then allow back what the build reads.
/*
!app
!components
!lib
!design-system
!brand-kit
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!next.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!eslint.config.mjs
